WEBVTT

00:00:57.428 --> 00:01:01.474
These doom-laden predictions
have not come true for many reasons,

00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:03.684
but two of them stand out
from my own research.

00:01:04.477 --> 00:01:06.604
First, there was limited
scientific knowledge

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:09.857
of how the virus would behave
in different populations

00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:11.192
and different environments.

00:01:11.859 --> 00:01:14.403
And second, there was an underestimation

00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:17.281
of Africa’s ability
to respond to a pandemic.

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:19.951
This led to predictions

00:01:19.951 --> 00:01:25.289
of Africa’s pandemic being extrapolated
from events in Asia and Europe.

00:01:25.998 --> 00:01:30.294
Now, my own work shows
that the global experts confused